{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01581","headline":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第十五拍 · 刘商","name":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第十五拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"叹息襟怀无定分，当时怨来归又恨。\n不知愁怨意若何？似有锋鋩扰方寸。\n悲欢竝行情未快，心意相尤自相问。\n不缘生得天属亲，岂向仇讐结恩信。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01581.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01581","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}